  Id: abandoned_cache
  Title: ABANDONED CACHE
  Body: Scouts report an untouched supply cache beyond the treeline.
  BodyVariants:
  - "Scouts found a supply depot beyond the treeline \u2014 abandoned in a hurry,
    still intact. We can strip it in one run, or put a crew on it and work it properly."
  - An old army cache, untouched since the fall. One big haul now, or a steady trickle
    if we man it.
  OutcomeA: The crews work fast and ugly. {GAIN_N} {GAIN_RES} reaches the stores
    by midday; the rest is left for the crows.
  OutcomeB: A crew digs in at the depot. {BOOST_RES} output is up {BOOST_PCT}% for
    the next {BOOST_D} days.
  Contrast: 0
  OptionAAtomIds:
  - gain_cache
  OptionBAtomIds:
  - boost_production
  OptionAVerb: Strip it now
  OptionBVerb: Work it properly
